@@ -13,3 +13,16 @@ A small team notes app. Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind.
 ```bash
 npm run dev
 ```
+
+## Database
+
+Users are stored in Postgres via Drizzle ORM (`src/db`, migrations in `drizzle/`).
+
+```bash
+cp .env.example .env.local
+docker compose up -d db
+npm run db:migrate
+npm run db:seed        # optional sample users
+```
+
+After editing `src/db/schema.ts`, run `npm run db:generate` and commit the new migration.
